---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import PageHeader from '@/components/PageHeader.astro'
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms" description="Elixir Community terms information.">
  <div class="container-page">
    <PageHeader title="Terms" />
    <article class="typography mt-12 max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm text-(--ec-muted)">Updated 7 October 2026</p>
<p>Elixir Community is a directory and newsletter about the Elixir programming community.</p>
<h2>Use the listings as a starting point</h2>
<p>We try to keep the information useful and accurate, but dates, jobs, links and services can change. Check with an event organiser, employer, publisher or service before relying on a listing. A historical entry does not mean a group, podcast or company is still active or using the same technology.</p>
<h2>Other people's work</h2>
<p>Links and images identify resources and their creators. Their names, trademarks and images belong to their respective owners. A listing does not imply endorsement or a partnership.</p>
<h2>The newsletter</h2>
<p>Subscribing is optional. Confirm your email to join and unsubscribe at any time. Our <a href="/privacy">privacy page</a> explains how signup data is used.</p>
<h2>Corrections</h2>
<p>Report an incorrect listing, broken link or rights concern to <a href="mailto:hello@elixir.community">hello@elixir.community</a>, or use the repository linked in the footer. Please do not send someone else's private information when suggesting a listing.</p>
<p>Nothing here takes away rights you have under applicable law.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
